meta {
  name: Annuler la commande B (PIN requis) -- etat terminal de nettoyage
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/api/orders/{{created_order_number_cancel}}/cancel
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
}

body {
  {
    "pin_email": "{{pin_email}}",
    "pin": "{{pin}}"
  }
}

docs {
order.cancel + PIN (RG-T13). Restocke automatiquement les ingredients consommes (RG-T20) : "cancelled" est aussi un etat terminal normal.
}
